Town at Stamford Bridge', 'chelsea-secure-2-0-win-over-luton-town-at-stamford-bridge-fdf7', 'The Blues jubilate tonight after a 2-0 victory over Luton Town in the Carabao Cup second round at Stamford Bridge. Danny Welbeck headed home his first Chelsea g…', '<p>The Blues jubilate tonight after a 2-0 victory over Luton Town in the Carabao Cup second round at Stamford Bridge. Danny Welbeck headed home his first Chelsea goal just after half-time from Malo Gusto’s cross, before a late own goal from Hakeem Odoffin, deflected from an Estevao  strike, sealed the win and a third-round home tie against Leeds United.</p><p>It was a tougher contest than the scoreline suggests. Luton stayed organised and threatened on the counter, forcing Chelsea to work hard after a goalless first half. Xabi Alonso’s rotated side, missing Enzo Fernandez and several injured players, eventually found a way through and can now look ahead with two wins from two under the new manager. </p><p>The new manager’s blend of youth, new signings and results has Stamford Bridge believing this Chelsea side might finally have the direction it has been missing.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​ Let’s see what the season brings </p>', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/db14mxnqt/image/upload/v1787863840/echo-gist/40e9bddb-450e-4128-88bb-1165336bdbf1/y6gglqsbb1btuyvgjvem.jpg', 'technology', '{}', 'c0de57af-f011-0e5a-ff55-c0de57aff555', TRUE, FALSE, 1, 11, 3, 0, '2026-08-27T20:50:51.654Z', '2026-09-15T15:56:18.926Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
